// Vitest Snapshot v1, https://vitest.dev/guide/snapshot.html

exports[`buildPrompt > renders the full template 1`] = `
"You are fixing the visual design of an existing front-end codebase. A static analyzer (uislop) scored it 47/100 ("Template Vibe"; lower is better) because it reads as AI-generated. Fix only the design issues listed below.

HARD CONSTRAINTS
- Do NOT change business logic: props, state, hooks, event handler bodies, data fetching, routing, form validation, API calls, types, or tests.
- Change presentation only: className/class strings, inline styles, CSS, static copy, icons, and the minimum markup (wrappers, semantics) needed for layout.
- Keep every import, export and component signature working. For icons, use the icon library already installed (lucide-react if present), otherwise inline SVG. Do not add dependencies.
- Wire-ups flagged as fake (dead links, empty or console-only handlers) are the exception: connect them to the real function or route that already exists in the code; if none exists, remove the control and say so in your summary.
- If a finding is intentional, keep the code and add \`// uislop-ignore <rule-id>\` above it ({/* uislop-ignore <rule-id> */} in JSX children, /* … */ in CSS, <!-- … --> in HTML) instead of rewriting.

FINDINGS (6 of 7, highest impact first)
src/Landing.tsx
- L14:5 [color-slop/ai-gradient] Gradient from-indigo-500 to-purple-500 is the default AI palette
  Fix: Fix for color-slop/ai-gradient.
- L20:5 [layout-slop/template-hero] Template hero: centered headline with pill badge and "Get Started"/"Learn More" buttons
  Fix: Fix for layout-slop/template-hero.
- L31:5 [fake-ui/dead-link] Dead link: href="#"
  Fix: Fix for fake-ui/dead-link.
- L44:5 [copy-slop/cliche-phrase] LLM cliché "supercharge"
  Fix: Fix for copy-slop/cliche-phrase.

src/Dashboard.tsx
- L8:5 [fake-ui/noop-handler] Button does nothing: onClick handler is empty
  Fix: Fix for fake-ui/noop-handler.

src/styles.css
- L2:5 [color-slop/neon-shadow] Neon tinted shadow box-shadow: 0 0 30px rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.5) (colored glow)
  Fix: Fix for color-slop/neon-shadow.

…and 1 more finding in 1 file. After fixing the above, re-run the check; the next ones will surface.

DESIGN DIRECTION
- Palette: neutrals from zinc/slate/neutral (text-zinc-900, bg-zinc-50, border-zinc-200); one accent used on primary actions only; no purple/indigo/pink gradients, no colored glows, no pure #000.
- Copy: specific and concrete; say what the product does for whom; no hype adjectives; realistic, varied sample names and data.
- Layout: break the symmetry: asymmetric grids, one radius (rounded-lg/xl), border instead of heavy shadows, a left-aligned hero with the real product visible.
- Typography: tabular-nums on every number/price/table cell; paragraphs capped with max-w-prose.
- Honesty: no dead links, no no-op buttons, no invented stats or testimonials; use real data or remove it.
- Prefer restraint: one accent color, one radius, one shadow level, consistent 4px spacing.

VERIFY
1. Run \`npx @stonexy/slopscan src --ci --max-slop 15\` and repeat until it exits 0. Do not satisfy it by adding uislop-ignore comments to real problems.
2. Run the project's typecheck, lint and tests; they must behave exactly as before your changes.
3. Reply with a short per-file summary (at most 5 lines) of what you changed."
`;
